  "scientific_review": [
    "All 30 original source cases are covered exactly once across three sequential canonical-owner exports: Atlantic, Pacific and Indian South Equatorial Currents, 10 each. This file retains one batch at native resolution under the fixed 2.4 MB bound. January 15 and July 15, 2022 00Z are individual model snapshots, not annual ranges or seasonal means. No new ocean retrieval.",
    "Reuse the entire validated NEC/subarctic curtain function unchanged with original NONINTERVAL longitude geometry, full finite upper-200 m surface-gated integral selector, explicit original primary threshold and validated graph/runs/vertical boundaries. No NEC recovery/completion logic is invoked. Verify this cohort own pinned operator, exact definitions, owner/date and batch matrix. All candidate scores, original selection/core/layer and seed-run boundaries reproduce; sources remain unchanged.",
    "Every basin member preserves 270-degree westward direction, 0.1 m/s primary at original index 1, 0.05 m/s surface gate, 0-200 m core search and null temperature gate. Original 27 interior and 3 gate-edge unresolved selections remain. No weaker interior core replacement or threshold/gate tuning.",
    "Strict four-native-axis-neighbor support without diagonal or missing bridges, interpolation or reselection. Preserve separate vertical runs, finite crossings and missing/domain/lateral censors. Surface connectivity describes topology only. Atlantic 31-35W central-context, Pacific 100-140W southern-branch and Indian 90-70E southern-zonal-mode partial searches do not independently establish named branches, full routes or a measured family. Do not transfer the separate 142E northern-component reference to the Pacific southern reach or inherit depths across basin/boundary currents.",
    "No independently validated body/axis/water-mass/physical bottom, annual extrema, whole-route physical depth, width/area/volume or new scalar references. Missing is not zero, seabed or current absence; native brackets are not uncertainty. Profile-date counts are not independent observations. Existing 808 heterogeneous depth references, fitted/regional products and 102 eddy size references remain. Main/runtime/UI unchanged.",
    "Cloud-only sequential one idle CPU: 4 original source checks plus 13 new checks and all actual builds. New tests block Dataset/urlopen, verify three bounded batches cover all 30 cases exactly once, unchanged validated function, westward frames/gates/surface topology, original source immutability and geometry/time/diagnosis mutation rejection. Local static editing/AST, metadata/hash and exact retention only."
  ],
